From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Steve Crass <scrass@anaconda.com>
Date: Thu, 27 Aug 2026 10:50:00 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] update protobuf install_requires for protobuf 7 stack

pip check reads wheel metadata from setup.py.in; protobuf 6.x bound fails
against the Stage 005 protobuf 7.35.1 host/run pins.
---
 ortools/python/setup.py.in | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/ortools/python/setup.py.in b/ortools/python/setup.py.in
index 1111111..2222222 100644
--- a/ortools/python/setup.py.in
+++ b/ortools/python/setup.py.in
@@ -46,7 +46,7 @@ setup(
         'absl-py >= 2.0.0',
         'numpy >= 2.0.2',
         'pandas >= 2.0.0',
-        'protobuf >= 6.33.1,<6.34',
+        'protobuf >= 7.35.1,<8',
         'typing-extensions >= 4.12',
         'immutabledict >= 3.0.0',
     ],
